From 7bdc5a5aebfd285932e43b321713ff7401f56988 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:13:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add XEP-0317 hats to MUC rooms

Rooms of a MUC service with the new 'hats' option can define hats
(URI, title, optional hue) and give them to users by bare JID. The
room adds the user's hats to every presence it broadcasts for them,
strips any hats sent by clients, advertises urn:xmpp:hats:0 in disco,
and stores hats with the room options.

Hats are managed with new admin GraphQL fields in the muc category:
setRoomHat, removeRoomHat, assignRoomHat, unassignRoomHat and
listRoomHats.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETaRHXo1LmPHqZB9SXMucM
